DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The oohhccii driver provides support for OHCI-type PCI based USB controllers.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The oohhccii driver supports all OHCI v1.0 compliant controllers including:

     ••   AcerLabs M5237 (Aladdin-V)
     ••   AMD-756
     ••   OPTi 82C861 (FireLink)
     ••   NEC uPD 9210
     ••   CMD Tech 670 (USB0670)
     ••   CMD Tech 673 (USB0673)
     ••   NVIDIA nForce3

